TEXT -1664 1104 Left 2 !.func wc(nom,tol,index) if(run==numruns,nom,if(binary(run,index),nom*(1+tol),nom*(1-tol)))\n.func binary(run,index) floor(run/(2**index))-2*floor(run/(2**(index+1)))
